.TH t.upgrade 1 "" "GRASS 8.4.1" "GRASS GIS User's Manual"
.SH NAME
\fI\fBt.upgrade.py\fR\fR  \- Upgrades the version of the temporal database.
.SH KEYWORDS
temporal, metadata, time
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBt.upgrade.py\fR
.br
\fBt.upgrade.py \-\-help\fR
.br
\fBt.upgrade.py\fR  [\-\-\fBhelp\fR]  [\-\-\fBverbose\fR]  [\-\-\fBquiet\fR]  [\-\-\fBui\fR]
.SS Flags:
.IP "\fB\-\-help\fR" 4m
.br
Print usage summary
.IP "\fB\-\-verbose\fR" 4m
.br
Verbose module output
.IP "\fB\-\-quiet\fR" 4m
.br
Quiet module output
.IP "\fB\-\-ui\fR" 4m
.br
Force launching GUI dialog
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fIt.upgrade\fR module upgrades the temporal database in the current
mapset from version 2 (default in GRASS 7) to 3 (default in GRASS 8).
The version 3 introduces a semantic label support, see
\fIi.band.library\fR for details.
.SH EXAMPLE
.br
.nf
\fC
t.upgrade
\fR
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fI
t.info
\fR
